{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-3-1-2-2:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_3_1_2_2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para_v2_n_3_1_2_2_001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究变量（估计目标属性二）为ORR（客观缓解率），即依据IMWG（国际骨髓瘤工作组）标准，最佳总体缓解达到≥PR（部分缓解）的试验参与者比例。仅以“疗效”等标签描述研究变量不满足本属性要求；本属性应同时明确变量定义、测量方式、聚合方式以及评价时间点或时间窗。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"para_v2_n_3_1_2_2_002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究变量属性表应逐项列明ORR的测量、聚合与时间点/窗口三类要素，不得仅保留表头或仅给出统计方法名称。已确认的变量定义如下表；测量、聚合与时间点/窗口中尚未确认的信息以显式待补充项标注。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk_v2_n_3_1_2_2_table_001\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"tbl_v2_n_3_1_2_2_variable_attributes\",\n        \"block_id\": \"blk_v2_n_3_1_2_2_table_001\",\n        \"title\": \"研究变量属性表\",\n        \"domain\": \"objectives_endpoints\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"schema_version\": \"structured_table_v1\",\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"source_locator\": \"\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"variable\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"label\": \"研究变量\",\n            \"semantic_role\": \"variable\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"measurement\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"label\": \"测量\",\n            \"semantic_role\": \"measurement\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"aggregation\",\n            \"order\": 2,\n            \